  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• In a baking dish, place capsicum and garlic cloves (no need to peel!).\n• Drizzle with olive oil, then bake until slightly charred and tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Remove from the oven, cover with foil and set aside to rest for 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f4f5ad8e6534c44381/step-2bd5c700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Finely chop celery.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f4f5ad8e6534c44381/step-3fc9e010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f4f5ad8e6534c44381/step-644a8820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the capsicum is resting, in a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Sprinkle with paprika spice blend.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f4f5ad8e6534c44381/step-470b8530.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Carefully peel capsicum and garlic, removing any stems and seeds.\n• Transfer capsicum and garlic to a food processor, then add roasted almonds, the white wine vinegar, salt, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and olive oil (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people).\n• Blitz until desired consistency. TIP: If you don't have a food processor, finely chop ingredients to form a chunky, rustic sauce!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f4f5ad8e6534c44381/step-f56e9540.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine celery, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Divide roast sweet potatoes, celery salad and paprika plant-based crumbed chicken between plates.\n• Serve with DIY romesco sauce. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06f4f5ad8e6534c44381/step-8024e450.jpg"
    }
  ]
